Package: LasForecast
Title: Lasso for Predictive Regressions
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Zhan", "Gao", email = "zhangao@smu.edu", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Zhentao", "Shi", email = "zhentaoshi@cuhk.edu.hk", role = "aut"),
    person("Ziwei", "Mei", email = "ziweimei@um.edu.mo", role = "aut"),
    person("Zihao", "Yin", email = "zihaoy@smu.edu", role = "ctb"))
Description: Provides a framework of Lasso for 
    predictive regressions in data-rich environments, automating parameter
    tuning, model estimation, rolling-window forecasting, backtesting, and
    visualization. It implements Lasso-type estimators tailored to predictive
    regressions with persistent and mixed-root regressors, including the plain,
    adaptive, and twin adaptive Lasso of Lee, Shi and Gao (2022)
    <doi:10.1016/j.jeconom.2021.02.002>, the standardized Lasso of Mei and Shi
    (2024) <doi:10.1016/j.jeconom.2024.105809>, and the IVX-desparsified Lasso
    of Gao, Lee, Mei and Shi (2026) <doi:10.1016/j.jeconom.2026.106240> for
    valid inference under both shrinkage and Stambaugh bias. 
Depends:
    R (>= 3.5.2)
